{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Amalek dwells in the land of the Negev.</b> While you are asking about the seven nations — ask about the people dwelling on the border, that is Amalek, who encountered them when they went out from Egypt." "<b>And the Amorite dwells in the mountain and the Canaanite dwells by the sea and by the Jordan.</b> And there is no open place for us to enter the land."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:50.609990698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}